       "html": "<div class='ig-page'><p class='ig-kicker'>The Collective</p><h1 class='ig-h1'>About Elkdonis Arts</h1><p class='ig-lead' style='margin-top:1.5rem'>A non-profit organization using art as a means of inquiry.</p><hr class='saffron-divider'><h2 class='ig-h2'>What is Art For?</h2><div class='ig-prose'><p>Objective art is made to affect the person who meets it in a known way, and the first question is what that way is.</p></div><hr class='saffron-divider'><h2 class='ig-h2'>Three Qualities</h2><div class='ig-quality'><span class='ig-quality-num'>I</span><div class='ig-prose'><p>Attention that can be held.</p></div></div><div class='ig-quality'><span class='ig-quality-num'>II</span><div class='ig-prose'><p>Feeling that is allowed to arrive.</p></div></div></div>"
